nnell, 2019", "2.8"], ["City View Post Acute, 2022", "5.3"], ["City View Post Acute, 2023", "3.2"], ["San Francisco Health Care & Rehab, 2024", "1.8"], ["The Sequoias San Francisco, 2025", "3.4"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.37, 0.71, 1.17, 1.35, 1.5, 1.6]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "story[3]", "story[4]", "established[2]"], "text": "In those years: 66 million dollars to related parties, against 26.6 million of losses.", "t0": 10.73, "t1": 16.3, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$66.0 million", "label": "to related parties, in those 25 home-years", "sub": "losses: $26.6 million"}, "emph": ["66 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.41, 0.89, 1.59, 1.9, 2.24, 2.34, 2.66, 3.13, 3.51, 4.06, 4.33, 4.6, 4.9, 4.99]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 16.72, "t1": 18.17, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.3, 0.38, 0.7, 0.87, 0.94]}, {"scene": "how", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "links[1]", "links[2]"], "text": "Homes often rent their buildings, and buy management or staff, from companies under the same owners.", "t0": 18.39, "t1": 23.13, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "The nursing home", "sub": "reports its profit or loss"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Related landlords", "sub": "rent"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Related management and staffing", "sub": "fees and staff"}], "kicker": "Under the same owners"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.73, 0.95, 1.11, 1.61, 1.8, 2.01, 2.52, 2.67, 3.06, 3.25, 3.69, 3.88, 3.96, 4.21]}, {"scene": "how", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "links[1]", "links[2]"], "text": "Each lists them in its report to the State.", "t0": 23.25, "t1": 25.23, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housin